00:30:12.159 --> 00:30:14.399
then age creeps up on you again. And as

00:30:14.399 --> 00:30:16.559
you get older, your mortality on any

00:30:16.559 --> 00:30:18.720
given day is actually really governed by

00:30:18.720 --> 00:30:20.960
