00:30:57.440 --> 00:30:59.679
kind of had this linear increase up into

00:30:59.679 --> 00:31:01.760
the the medieval plateau, I&#x27;ll call it,

00:31:01.760 --> 00:31:03.760
uh, and then into our industrial sigmoid

00:31:03.760 --> 00:31:05.679
function. But how did this sigmoidal

00:31:05.679 --> 00:31:07.679
