00:31:14.080 --> 00:31:16.240
that gave rise to this uh this increased

00:31:16.240 --> 00:31:18.320
slope uh in the industrial era in the

00:31:18.320 --> 00:31:20.799
developed world. We then had kind of in

00:31:20.799 --> 00:31:23.120
the early 1900s post World War II or

00:31:23.120 --> 00:31:24.799
around World War II, we had modern

00:31:24.799 --> 00:31:26.480
antibiotics. We had penicellin and then

00:31:26.480 --> 00:31:28.480
further we had kind of these modern

00:31:28.480 --> 00:31:31.480
