00:31:31.480 --> 00:31:34.640
longevity. Then kind of in the 70s uh

00:31:34.640 --> 00:31:36.640
and and then you know a bit further we

00:31:36.640 --> 00:31:38.320
started to tackle chronic diseases. We

00:31:38.320 --> 00:31:40.320
got better at diabetes. Um we got better

00:31:40.320 --> 00:31:42.159
at tackling heart disease. we got better

00:31:42.159 --> 00:31:44.159
at cancers. You know, breast cancer is

