how can we really quantify this vibe

00:34:50.240 --> 00:34:52.879
about lifespan? So starting in the

00:34:52.879 --> 00:34:55.200
Renaissance era uh there&#x27;s this guy uh

00:34:55.200 --> 00:34:57.760
Santoro Santoro and he wrote a book

00:34:57.760 --> 00:35:00.960
called Dstatistica Metachina. Um in it

00:35:00.960 --> 00:35:03.119
he was kind of like a Renaissance era

00:35:03.119 --> 00:35:05.200
Bryan Johnson. Uh he was weighing

