invisible. We quantify them. this gut

00:36:01.359 --> 00:36:02.800
feeling that we have when we see a

00:36:02.800 --> 00:36:04.640
patient as a physician or when you you

00:36:04.640 --> 00:36:06.560
feel something yourself, we quantify

00:36:06.560 --> 00:36:08.880
them using a biomarker. And so what is a

00:36:08.880 --> 00:36:11.280
biomarker? A biomarker is a measurable

00:36:11.280 --> 00:36:13.359
indicator of a biological state. They

00:36:13.359 --> 00:36:15.839
help us to understand and measure age,

00:36:15.839 --> 00:36:18.960
health and longevity itself. Now a

