00:37:59.920 --> 00:38:01.599
This next slide demonstrates a very

00:38:01.599 --> 00:38:03.440
important paradigm in the field of

00:38:03.440 --> 00:38:06.240
longevity science. Um, so what a lot of

00:38:06.240 --> 00:38:08.240
researchers in this field do for the

